; ●シーン1‐1-b3
; ========================================
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:12_1

[PrintTextModified Text:表示了同意。|#0101Bad03_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，说不定能发现一些<br>有助于越狱的提示。|#0101Bad03_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉从最边上的书架开始，按顺序调查书本。|#0101Bad03_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_1 Volume:0.6 Loop:true FadeInDuration:2
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_2 Volume:0 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:很多书都没办法阅读啊。<br>似乎也没有明显的信息……|#0101Bad03_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:时间不断前进，但她们仍毫无收获。<br>此时，艾玛打开了不知是第几册的书本。|#0101Bad03_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>【好恨】</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:噫……！？|#0101Bad03_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛？你怎么啦？|#0101Bad03_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised

[PrintTextModified Text:这、这本书……！<br>又出现了像刚刚一样的文字！|#0101Bad03_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:噢噢，真叫人兴奋耶！|#0101Bad03_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉的眼睛闪烁着光，转头看向艾玛手上的书本。|#0101Bad03_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，好像这里也写了些什么耶。|#0101Bad03_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在页面边缘处，同样留下了疑似血字的<br><color=#ff0000>【←】</color>标记。|#0101Bad03_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个箭头是什么？|#0101Bad03_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……会不会是指示我们翻开下一页呢。|#0101Bad03_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 本のページをめくる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_43 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:原来如此，艾玛恍然大悟般翻开了下一页。|#0101Bad03_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Fearful1

[PrintTextModified Text:！！|#0101Bad03_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛顿时变得脸色煞白。<br>书本上出现的不再是像之前一样的短短一行字，<br>而是一篇密密麻麻的文章。|#0101Bad03_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这、这是什么……|#0101Bad03_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来真的是之前被抓来这里的人<br>留下的文字。你看。|#0101Bad03_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的视线转到雪莉指向的部分。|#0101Bad03_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>一醒来，发现自己在牢房之中——</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>年纪相近的女孩子被关在一起——</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:囚犯、魔女、凶杀案……|#0101Bad03_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:跟我们目前的状况，<br>还有典狱长的说明都是一致的呢。|#0101Bad03_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉继续往下阅读。|#0101Bad03_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只不过，多处字迹都出现了墨水化开或消失的现象，<br>只能断断续续地看下去。|#0101Bad03_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:文章一开头也只是平淡地记录着发生的事情，<br>但越往后，文章内就混有越多的诅咒。|#0101Bad03_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_1 Volume:0 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0 Duration:2
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_2 Volume:0.8 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0 Duration:2

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>憎恨，不可原谅，再也不信任任何人——</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对下一个人被杀的或许就是自己的恐惧。<br>对其他少女的怀疑和怨恨话语——这些元素不断在文章中重复。|#0101Bad03_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>终于，只剩下3个人了。</color><br><color=#ff0000>这下，也许总归轮到我死了。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>救命。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>我想回家。</color><br><color=#ff0000>爸爸、妈妈，我想见你们。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>为什么我非得遇到这些事不可？</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>我没有错。</color><br><color=#ff0000>我没有错。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>明明我没有错，为什么是我？</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>好恨。</color><br><color=#ff0000>不可原谅。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>再这么下去，只会被杀。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>对了。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>我想到办法了。</color><br><color=#ff0000>为什么我一直以来都没察觉到呢。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>只要在被杀之前，我去杀死其他人就好了。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>不过，她们肯定也在想同一回事。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>不可原谅。不可原谅。不可原谅。</color><br><color=#ff0000>我要诅咒。承受痛苦吧。</color><br><color=#ff0000>该承受痛苦的，是你们才对。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:<color=#ff0000>在痛苦之中，去死就好了。</color>|#0101Bad03_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:读到下一行字后，艾玛发出短暂的惊叫声，<br>把手从书本上抽开。|#0101Bad03_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

